# API


---

### listUsers

> BASIC


**Path:** /users

**Method:** GET

**Desc:**

listUsers returns a filtered page of users.

> REQUEST

**Query:**

| name | value | required | desc |
| ------------ | ------------ | ------------ | ------------ |
| keyword |  | YES |  |
| page | 1 | NO |  |


> RESPONSE

**Body:**

| name | type | desc |
| ------------ | ------------ | ------------ |
| key | string |  |
| value | null |  |


**Response Demo:**

```json
{
  "key": null
}
```

---

### createUser

> BASIC


**Path:** /users

**Method:** POST

**Desc:**

createUser registers a new account.

> REQUEST

**Request Body:**

| name | type | desc |
| ------------ | ------------ | ------------ |
| email | string |  |
| name | string |  |
| password | string |  |
| tags | string[] |  |


**Request Demo:**

```json
{
  "email": "",
  "name": "",
  "password": "",
  "tags": [
    ""
  ]
}
```

> RESPONSE

**Body:**

| name | type | desc |
| ------------ | ------------ | ------------ |
| age | int |  |
| email | string |  |
| id | long |  |
| name | string |  |


**Response Demo:**

```json
{
  "age": 0,
  "email": "",
  "id": 0,
  "name": ""
}
```

---

### getUser

> BASIC


**Path:** /users/:id

**Method:** GET

**Desc:**

getUser returns a single user by id.

> REQUEST

**Path Params:**

| name | value | required | desc |
| ------------ | ------------ | ------------ | ------------ |
| id |  | YES |  |


**Headers:**

| name | value | required | desc |
| ------------ | ------------ | ------------ | ------------ |
| X-Request-Id |  | NO |  |


> RESPONSE

**Body:**

| name | type | desc |
| ------------ | ------------ | ------------ |
| age | int |  |
| email | string |  |
| id | long |  |
| name | string |  |


**Response Demo:**

```json
{
  "age": 0,
  "email": "",
  "id": 0,
  "name": ""
}
```

