> BASIC


**Path:** /users/:id

**Method:** PUT

**Desc:**

updateUser updates an existing user.

> REQUEST

**Path Params:**

| name | value | required | desc |
| ------------ | ------------ | ------------ | ------------ |
| id |  | YES |  |


**Request Body:**

| name | type | desc |
| ------------ | ------------ | ------------ |
| email | string |  |
| name | string |  |


**Request Demo:**

```json
{
  "email": "",
  "name": ""
}
```

> RESPONSE

**Body:**

| name | type | desc |
| ------------ | ------------ | ------------ |
| age | int |  |
| email | string |  |
| id | long |  |
| name | string |  |


**Response Demo:**

```json
{
  "age": 0,
