### deleteUser

> BASIC


**Path:** /users/:id

**Method:** DELETE

**Desc:**

deleteUser removes a user by id.

> REQUEST

**Path Params:**

| name | value | required | desc |
| ------------ | ------------ | ------------ | ------------ |
| id |  | YES |  |

